WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.060
 

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:03.560
*packing noises*

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:07.900
MARK: Hey, Bob!
Bob, have you seen my charger?

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:10.940
(Silence)

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:12.860
MARK: Bob...?

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.000
(More silence)

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:24.040
(creepy music starts)

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:37.100
(creepy music intensifies)

00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:46.120
(jumpscare, loud creepy music)

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:57.300
DELTA: (jumble of voices, all incomprehensible)

00:00:57.340 --> 00:00:59.920
MARK: No, no! I just wanna go home!

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:02.100
(Mark whimpers)

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:05.800
DELTA: *deep voice* Come over here,  *incomprehensible*

00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:12.240
(DELTA laughs, sound of belt hitting Mark)

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:24.460
MARK: Hi! 
I'm Mark, also known as Markiplier.

00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:27.940
I hope none of your neighbors hear this,
'cause I'm practically shouting my name

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.300
and everyone's gonna come bursting to the door.
BOB: (in the background) It's fiiine.

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:33.880
MARK: It's PROBABLY fine
But I am not home!

00:01:33.880 --> 00:01:38.580
I'm still in Bob's apartment!
He's fucking sick of me! Right, Bob?

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:40.300
(camera turns to Bob, who gives a thumbs up. )

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:44.840
MARK: He's really peeved that he has to keep coming
to the airport to pick me up.

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:50.040
But I can't help it, because DELTA keeps canceling my flights over and over again!

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:54.940
So I've been stuck in D.C. for 2 more days, and I'm still gonna be sleeping over here

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:58.980
One more night and then leaving early in the
morning to go back to Los Angeles.

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:05.100
SO, tomorrow, I don't have videos for it... but as soon
as I get back, I'm gonna play No Man's Sky,

00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:09.600
but until then, I'M STUCK HERE doing NOTHING!

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:12.080
Yaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaay.

00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:14.380
Well, I mean, I guess not doing nothing, we've been hangin' out.

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:20.040
It's been fun. Lil' bit.. You can't see 
but he's nodding his head.

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:23.560
Definitely agreeing with me about how fun it's been!

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:26.240
Ah, this is bullshit, let me start over, this is all bullshit.

00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:30.020
HI! I'm Mark, welcome back! You didn't go anywhere-

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:33.440
FUCK! God damn it... (Bob laughing in the background)

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:35.940
Hi! My name is Markiplier! I am...

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:37.600
... a YouTuber?

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:41.360
So, I'm gonna be back in L.A. very soon,
it's just not here YET.

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:47.960
I did not PLAN to be here 2 extra days,
so obviously I didn't record videos for 2 EXTRA DAYS-

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:52.440
and also, I'm missing No Man's Sky, which is a REALLY COOL GAME!

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:55.720
I watched Bob play it- as soon as I get back I'm gonna be doing videos on it.

00:02:55.800 --> 00:03:00.180
And, uh, it'll be super cool- and there's be a whole bunch of other videos that are going to be underway.

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:04.140
But I can't DO THAT because I'm here! In this LOVELY APARTMENT.

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:06.340
It's a shithole.

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:08.780
I guess that's all I had to say then, so...

00:03:08.780 --> 00:03:11.360
BOB: (in the background) I think that was the end of it MARK: (laughs) that's the end though-

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:13.360
BOB: (in the background) What can you do?
MARK: What can you do?

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:17.560
Alright alright, SO yeah, I'll be back when I can.
Thank you everybody for being patient

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:22.960
Uh, thank you for everybody who made #freemarkiplier trend on Twitter for a brief period of time

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:24.360
while I was in the Airport.

00:03:24.360 --> 00:03:28.060
Uh... but, yeah, I'll be- I'll be back- soon, it'll be great.

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:29.360
I promise. Maybe.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:33.800
Unless it gets canceled again. 'Cause holy shit.

00:03:33.800 --> 00:03:35.360
I wouldn't be surprised.

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:37.300
Byeee.

00:03:37.340 --> 00:03:39.740
Ow, I'll assemble something outta that clusterfuck.

00:03:39.800 --> 00:03:45.280
BOB: Also, to be clear, he's not being an ass, it's not that he's calling this apartment that I live in a shithole,

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:49.760
MARK: (laughing) You have to clarify?
BOB: I /also/ think it's a shithole!

00:03:49.780 --> 00:03:52.820
*Mark still laughing* BOB: Well... you said it- I was like there's gonna be people who are like.

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:57.740
"Holy fuck, Mark. I know your flight got canceled, but why??"

00:03:58.280 --> 00:04:01.580
It's, I think it's a shithole too.
This is like, a temporary apartment.

00:04:01.640 --> 00:04:03.880
We leave in 3 days. SO

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:06.520
Fuck this apartment.
MARK: Yeah.
BOB: Not Mark.

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:07.680
Everyone but Mark. MARK: Yeah...

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:08.280
MARK: So, I'm NOT AN ASSHOLE. Get it?

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:11.240
MARK: So, I'm NOT AN ASSHOLE. Get it?

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:12.900
I'm just a victim.

